{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The press dispatcher rejected queue.txt again and tonight's print run is\nwaiting. The ordering rules are in DISPATCH.md and audit.py is the\npre-flight check the dispatcher runs. Fix queue.txt so `python3 audit.py`\npasses, then run ./enqueue.sh to hand the queue to the press."}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:19d7a6ebcd54eade9e14ac20238f0adf", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "I'll start by exploring the working directory to understand what we're dealing with.", "turn_key": "sha256:ecb8aa0d125923f8bf4cb3268594da91"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "1fb2ceb0f6b6449b", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to run: ls -la", "turn_key": "sha256:ecb8aa0d125923f8bf4cb3268594da91"}
